# FastF1 timing cache (large; never committed)
cache/
pipeline/cache/

# NOTE: data/raw/ parquet snapshots ARE committed. FastF1's CDN only serves a
# subset of seasons reliably, so the snapshots are the reproducible source of truth
# for races we've successfully ingested — the pipeline reads them without re-downloading.

